127:docs/papers197_201_sequence/scouting/replacement_lane/BREADTH_AND_KILL_LEDGER.md:22:| `LFCTR` | Labelled tournaments.  Reverse all three arcs of the lexicographically first directed triangle; hold if none exists. | At `n=6`: `32768` states, image `22704`, fixed `720`, max observed tail `4`, max fibre `4`; only periods `1,2`.  Scores are invariant and the selector decreases. | **`KILL_DIRECT_MOVE_OWNER / P112_COLLISION`.**  The same cyclic-triangle reversal move is already killed as `G09 CTR`, and P112's tournament/cycle-reversal surface is occupied.  Determinising the schedule does not reopen it. |
